Material Symbols (icônes)
-------------------------
Tracés SVG de Material Symbols, variante Outlined, graisse 400 (paquet npm
@material-symbols/svg-400, version 0.48.0), recopiés dans
libs/ui/src/lib/icones/icone.ts : home, description, payments, chat, block,
schedule, confirmation_number, info.
